# Static force evaluation only; no minimization or MD.
clear
units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
read_data structure.data
include potential.interface_calibration_v0.inc
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step atoms pe etotal press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify format float %.16g
run 0
write_dump all custom lammps_forces_precise.dump id type x y z fx fy fz modify sort id format float %.16e
